00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Depreciation allocates an asset’s cost under an accounting method; it is not the same as a quote or resale price.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
A $1,000 depreciable basis over 5 equal years is $200/year under straight-line assumptions, before tax rules.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
